^bo^un1. Scope^un^bo

This document explains the concepts underlying GRiDNetwork Manager (called Network Manager in the remainder of this document), and defines its external specifications.

^bo1.1 Terminology^bo

Refer to GRiDMail Overview Specification (Doc. No. 800077).

^bo1.2 References^bo

Refer to GRiDMail Overview Specification (Doc. No. 800077).
